{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06217","headline":"春日与王右丞过新昌里访吕逸人不遇 · 裴迪","name":"春日与王右丞过新昌里访吕逸人不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恨不逢君出荷蓑，青松白屋更无他。\n陶令五男曾不有，蒋生三径枉相过。\n芙蓉曲沼春流满，薜荔成帷晚霭多。\n闻说桃源好迷客，不如高卧眄庭柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴迪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}